WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Mia: What is that? It looks a little strange to me.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Daniel: It’s kimchi. My family eats it with different meals.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
Mia: I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to judge it. It’s just new to me. What does it taste like?

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
Daniel: It can be spicy and sour.

00:22.000 --> 00:28.000
Mia: That sounds interesting. Thanks for explaining.
